{"type":"message","id":"40676b5e","parentId":"8f722e9f","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:09.087Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Sat 2026-03-14 03:00 GMT+8] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/2). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: 作为查事小弟，用playwright访问中华人民共和国科学技术部网站 http://www.most.gov.cn/，找到通知公告栏目，提取以下CSS选择器：\n1. 公告列表容器选择器\n2. 单个公告条目选择器\n3. 公告标题选择器\n4. 公告跳转链接选择器\n5. 公告发布日期选择器\n返回选择器和验证结果，确保能正确提取最新科技政策公告。"}],"timestamp":1773428409086}}
{"type":"message","id":"f38c4eb2","parentId":"40676b5e","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:00:29.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n用户现在需要我作为查事小弟用playwright访问科技部网站提取CSS选择器对吧？首先得先写个playwright的脚本对吧？首先得安装playwright？不对，先创建个脚本文件，然后运行它？\n首先，我需要写一个Node.js的playwright脚本，访问http://www.most.gov.cn/，找到通知公告栏目，然后提取对应的选择器，还要验证能提取到内容对吧？\n对，首先先创建这个脚本文件，就叫scrape_most.js吧，然后写内容：\n首先导入playwright，然后启动浏览器，访问网站，等待加载，找到通知公告的部分，然后找对应的选择器，然后输出结果，还要打印提取到的几个公告验证对吧？\n然后写完脚本之后，运行它？首先得确保playwright安装了？不对，先写脚本，然后执行，要是没装的话再装？不过先写脚本吧。\n等下，首先用write工具创建scrape_most.js文件，内容就是playwright的脚本：\n内容大概是：\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  await page.goto('http://www.most.gov.cn/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle' });\n  \n  // 首先找到通知公告栏目\n  const noticeSection = page.locator('div.notice'); // 不对，要实际找，所以脚本里先打印页面结构？不对，应该先定位通知公告的部分，然后提取选择器。\n  // 哦对，脚本里应该先找通知公告的容器，然后输出对应的选择器，然后提取内容验证。\n  // 等下，我应该写个通用的，先定位到通知公告栏目，然后获取各个选择器，然后打印结果。\n  // 对，写好脚本之后运行，就会输出我们需要的选择器和验证结果了。\n然后，写完脚本之后，执行node scrape_most.js对吧？还要先安装playwright？哦对，可能需要先npm init -y，然后npm install playwright，然后npx playwright install chromium对吧？\n所以步骤：\n1. 写scrape_most.js脚本\n2. 安装依赖\n3. 运行脚本，获取结果\n\n首先，先调用write工具写脚本：\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ytxr2kx1ximhmai1npwmimpa","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"scrape_most.js","content":"const { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({ headless: true });\n  const page = await browser.newPage({\n    userAgent: 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/122.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\n  });\n\n  try {\n    console.log('正在访问科技部网站...');\n    await page.goto('http://www.most.gov.cn/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle', timeout: 30000 });\n\n    // 定位通知公告栏目\n    console.log('正在定位通知公告栏目...');\n    const noticeSection = page.locator('.main02_r');\n    await noticeSection.waitFor({ timeout: 5000 });\n\n    // 1. 公告列表容器选择器\n    const listContainerSelector = '.main02_r > ul';\n    const listContainer = page.locator(listContainerSelector);\n    await listContainer.waitFor({ timeout: 5000 });\n\n    // 2. 单个公告条目选择器\n    const itemSelector = `${listContainerSelector} > li`;\n    const items = listContainer.locator('li');\n    const itemCount = await items.count();\n    console.log(`找到 ${itemCount} 条公告`);\n\n    // 3. 公告标题选择器\n    const titleSelector = `${itemSelector} > a`;\n    // 4. 公告链接选择器\n    const linkSelector = `${itemSelector} > a`;\n    // 5. 公告发布日期选择器\n    const dateSelector = `${itemSelector} > span`;\n\n    console.log('\\n✅ 提取到的CSS选择器:');\n    console.log('1. 公告列表容器选择器:', listContainerSelector);\n    console.log('2. 单个公告条目选择器:', itemSelector);\n    console.log('3. 公告标题选择器:', titleSelector);\n    console.log('4. 公告跳转链接选择器:', linkSelector);\n    console.log('5. 公告发布日期选择器:', dateSelector);\n\n    console.log('\\n✅ 验证结果(前5条公告):');\n    for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(5, itemCount); i++) {\n      const item = items.nth(i);\n      const title = await item.locator('a').innerText();\n      const link = await item.locator('a').getAttribute('href');\n      const date = await item.locator('span').innerText();\n      console.log(`\\n${i+1}. 标题: ${title}`);\n      console.log(`   链接: http://www.most.gov.cn${link.startsWith('/') ? link : '/' + link}`);\n      console.log(`   日期: ${date}`);\n    }\n\n    console.log('\\n✅ 所有选择器验证通过，可以正常提取公告内容');\n\n  } catch (error) {\n    console.error('❌ 操作失败:', error.message);\n  } finally {\n    await browser.close();\n  }\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428409087}}
