{"type":"message","id":"9caefebc","parentId":"7f7d37c3","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:01:02.118Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，原来选择器不对，.main02_r找不到，那我得修改脚本，先打印页面里的主要板块，看看通知公告栏的类名是什么对吧？修改脚本，先获取页面里的所有div的类名，或者先找包含\"通知公告\"文字的板块。\n对，修改scrape_most.js，先找包含\"通知公告\"的元素，然后往上找父容器，获取它的类名。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ssmscm95cq6o3qmz7c7tdd6w","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"scrape_most.js","oldText":"    // 定位通知公告栏目\n    console.log('正在定位通知公告栏目...');\n    const noticeSection = page.locator('.main02_r');\n    await noticeSection.waitFor({ timeout: 5000 });","newText":"    // 定位通知公告栏目\n    console.log('正在定位通知公告栏目...');\n    // 先找包含\"通知公告\"文字的标题\n    const noticeTitle = page.getByText('通知公告', { exact: true });\n    await noticeTitle.waitFor({ timeout: 10000 });\n    // 往上找父容器，直到找到包含列表的板块\n    const noticeSection = noticeTitle.locator('xpath=../..');\n    const sectionClass = await noticeSection.getAttribute('class');\n    console.log('通知公告板块类名:', sectionClass);"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428446207}}
