{"type":"message","id":"b084b1df","parentId":"53f8df49","timestamp":"2026-03-13T19:03:48.463Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"\n哦，curl返回的内容里没有这些关键词？那说明curl得到的内容是被反爬拦截了？哦，对了，政府网站现在都有反爬，curl不带user agent的话会被拦截。那我给curl加个user agent试试。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_m953wzfvah2yzpnxk7pniezy","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -A \"Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/126.0.0.0 Safari/537.36\" https://www.most.gov.cn/ | grep -o \"href=\\\"[^\\\"]*\\\"\" | head -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volces-com","model":"ark-code-latest","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773428624000}}
